The '''Mygeeto system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Albarrio sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]], and contained the [[crystal]]line [[planet]] [[Mygeeto]].<ref name="BMF 45" /> It was home to the native [[Lurmen]] [[species]].<ref name="Mygeeto" />

